      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "TRUNKEY CHIEF (5) was strongly fancied last time on the back of some superb recent form, including a two-run winning streak, but could only manage fifth (30.48) at Wentworth Park. Goes very well from this draw with five wins and three minor placings from 10 starts. Rates on top in this line up. BOSTON BANNER (1) was out of the placings last time when sixth at Bulli (23.24) but did record second best time of the card when winning four back. Has a good record here at this journey. Solid formlines coming through his last run. Cannot be taken lightly. MEPUNGA SHINE (2) spotted a start but wound up strongly late and finished third and beaten 1.5 lengths (18.34) at this track in Mix 1/2/3. Winning chance. GOLDEN BLEND (8) can measure up with the right run.",
